$MDESC::Type = "HardCorps";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Seven-7" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> battle each other with their massive flying bases.  Each team must grab the other's flag and successfully bring it back to their base to capture it for a point.  The first team to reach 8 points shall be the victor!  A central missile platform whose fire arcs are controlled by remote switches at the bottom each team's base is also worth points for capturing and holding.\n\n<f1>HARD CORPS map by:<f0> [SHIT]Warpath";